{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-0","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-0","charStart":1,"charEnd":10,"text":"# 第11章 常数"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-1","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-1","charStart":12,"charEnd":88,"text":"> 数学中有一组特殊的数——它们不是被任意定义的，而是在完全不同的数学情境中反复\"自然涌现\"。这些常数是数学结构的\"DNA\"，连接着看似毫无关联的领域。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-2","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-2","charStart":90,"charEnd":93,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-3","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-3","charStart":95,"charEnd":116,"text":"## 11.1 $\\pi$：圆与周期的常数"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-4","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-4","charStart":118,"charEnd":126,"text":"### 几何定义"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-5","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-5","charStart":128,"charEnd":168,"text":"$$\n\\pi = \\frac{\\text{圆周长}}{\\text{直径}}\n$$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-6","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-6","charStart":170,"charEnd":185,"text":"### $\\pi$ 的无处不在"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-7","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-7","charStart":187,"charEnd":206,"text":"$\\pi$ 出现在看似与圆无关的地方："}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-8","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-8","charStart":208,"charEnd":697,"text":"| 公式 | 领域 | 为什么有 $\\pi$？ |\n|------|------|-----------------|\n| $\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{1}{n^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}$ | 数论/级数 | Basel 问题 |\n| $\\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty e^{-x^2}dx = \\sqrt{\\pi}$ | 概率/分析 | Gaussian 积分 |\n| $\\frac{1}{\\pi} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{9801}\\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\frac{(4k)!(1103+26390k)}{(k!)^4 396^{4k}}$ | 数值计算 | Ramanujan 公式 |\n| $\\Gamma(\\frac{1}{2}) = \\sqrt{\\pi}$ | 特殊函数 | Gamma 函数 |\n| $\\prod_{p\\text{ prime}} \\left(1-\\frac{1}{p^2}\\right)^{-1} = \\frac{\\pi^2}{6}$ | 数论 | Euler 乘积 |"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-9","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-9","charStart":699,"charEnd":793,"text":"> $\\pi$ 在 Basel 问题中的出现是深层的：$\\sum 1/n^2$ 是一个\"离散的和\"，但答案却包含 $\\pi$——连续几何的常数。这就是分析学中\"离散→连续\"联系的经典案例。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-10","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-10","charStart":795,"charEnd":798,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-11","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-11","charStart":800,"charEnd":819,"text":"## 11.2 $e$：自然增长的常数"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-12","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-12","charStart":821,"charEnd":829,"text":"### 来源定义"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-13","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-13","charStart":831,"charEnd":944,"text":"$$\ne = \\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{n}\\right)^n = \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{n!} \\approx 2.71828\\ldots\n$$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-14","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-14","charStart":946,"charEnd":959,"text":"### $e$ 的独特性质"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-15","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-15","charStart":961,"charEnd":986,"text":"$e^x$ 是唯一一个**导数等于自身**的函数："}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-16","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-16","charStart":988,"charEnd":1016,"text":"$$\n\\frac{d}{dx} e^x = e^x\n$$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-17","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-17","charStart":1018,"charEnd":1079,"text":"这意味着 $e$ 是描述\"变化率与当前值成正比\"的自然底数——复利、人口增长、放射性衰变、RC电路都遵循 $e$ 的模式。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-18","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-18","charStart":1081,"charEnd":1103,"text":"### $e$ 与复数的结合：欧拉公式的证明"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-19","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-19","charStart":1105,"charEnd":1143,"text":"从 $e^x$、$\\sin x$、$\\cos x$ 的 Taylor 级数："}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-20","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-20","charStart":1145,"charEnd":1477,"text":"$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ne^{i\\theta} &= \\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{(i\\theta)^n}{n!} = \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\left[\\frac{(i\\theta)^{2k}}{(2k)!} + \\frac{(i\\theta)^{2k+1}}{(2k+1)!}\\right] \\\\\n&= \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\frac{(-1)^k\\theta^{2k}}{(2k)!} + i\\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\frac{(-1)^k\\theta^{2k+1}}{(2k+1)!} \\\\\n&= \\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-21","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-21","charStart":1479,"charEnd":1522,"text":"令 $\\theta = \\pi$，得到 **$e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0$**。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-22","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-22","charStart":1524,"charEnd":1624,"text":"![e^{iπ}+1=0——复平面上从(1,0)沿单位圆旋转π弧度到达(-1,0)，加1回到原点](../images/11-constants/11-constants_eiπ10-复平面.png)"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-23","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-23","charStart":1626,"charEnd":1629,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-24","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-24","charStart":1631,"charEnd":1647,"text":"## 11.3 $i$：虚数单位"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-25","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-25","charStart":1649,"charEnd":1701,"text":"$i = \\sqrt{-1}$ 是\"方向\"的常数——乘以 $i$ = 逆时针旋转 $90^\\circ$。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-26","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-26","charStart":1703,"charEnd":1850,"text":"| 幂次 | 值 | 几何意义 |\n|:---:|-----|---------|\n| $i^1$ | $i$ | 旋转90° |\n| $i^2$ | $-1$ | 旋转180° |\n| $i^3$ | $-i$ | 旋转270° |\n| $i^4$ | $1$ | 旋转360°=回到原点 |"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-27","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-27","charStart":1852,"charEnd":1919,"text":"> $i$ 和 $e$ 通过欧拉公式组合后，统一了代数（多项式方程 $x^2+1=0$）、几何（旋转）、分析（指数/三角函数的统一）。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-28","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-28","charStart":1921,"charEnd":1924,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-29","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-29","charStart":1926,"charEnd":1962,"text":"## 11.4 $\\gamma$：Euler-Mascheroni 常数"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-30","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-30","charStart":1964,"charEnd":2064,"text":"$$\n\\gamma = \\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\left(\\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{1}{k} - \\ln n\\right) \\approx 0.57721\\ldots\n$$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-31","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-31","charStart":2066,"charEnd":2143,"text":"$\\gamma$ 衡量了**调和级数的部分和与自然对数的渐近差距**。至今不知道 $\\gamma$ 是有理数还是无理数——这是数学中著名的未解决问题之一。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-32","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-32","charStart":2145,"charEnd":2163,"text":"### $\\gamma$ 的出现场景"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-33","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-33","charStart":2165,"charEnd":2325,"text":"- $\\Gamma'(1) = -\\gamma$（Gamma 函数的导数）\n- $\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x}\\ln x \\,dx = -\\gamma$\n- 素数分布：$\\prod_{p \\leq n} \\left(1-\\frac{1}{p}\\right)^{-1} \\sim e^\\gamma \\ln n$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-34","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-34","charStart":2327,"charEnd":2330,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-35","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-35","charStart":2332,"charEnd":2354,"text":"## 11.5 $\\varphi$：黄金比例"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-36","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-36","charStart":2356,"charEnd":2414,"text":"$$\n\\varphi = \\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\approx 1.61803\\ldots\n$$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-37","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-37","charStart":2416,"charEnd":2433,"text":"### $\\varphi$ 的性质"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-38","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-38","charStart":2435,"charEnd":2615,"text":"- **二次方程根**：$\\varphi^2 = \\varphi + 1$\n- **连分数**（最简单的无限连分数）：$\\varphi = 1 + \\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\cdots}}$\n- **与 Fibonacci 的关系**：$F_n = \\frac{\\varphi^n - (-\\varphi)^{-n}}{\\sqrt{5}}$"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-39","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-39","charStart":2617,"charEnd":2629,"text":"### 为什么\"黄金\"？"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-40","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-40","charStart":2631,"charEnd":2698,"text":"一个矩形的长宽比为 $\\varphi$ 时，去掉一个正方形后，剩下的小矩形与原矩形相似——这种自相似性是 $\\varphi$ 的本质。"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-41","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-41","charStart":2700,"charEnd":2703,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-42","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-42","charStart":2705,"charEnd":2719,"text":"## 11.6 常数的关系网"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-43","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-43","charStart":2721,"charEnd":3117,"text":"```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    PI[\"pi = 3.14159\"] --- EULER[\"e^(i*pi)+1=0\"] --- E[\"e = 2.71828\"]\n    PI --- I[\"i = √-1\"]\n    E --- I\n    PI --- GAMMA[\"γ ≈ 0.57721\"]\n    GAMMA --- E\n    PI --- PHI[\"φ = (1+√5)/2\"]\n    PHI --- ROOT5[\"√5\"]\n    \n    EULER -.- NOTE[\"最美的公式<br/>连接5个核心常数\"]\n    \n    style EULER fill:#e74c3c,color:#fff\n    style PI fill:#2980b9,color:#fff\n    style E fill:#27ae60,color:#fff\n```"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-44","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-44","charStart":3119,"charEnd":3130,"text":"### 五大常数一览表"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-45","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-45","charStart":3132,"charEnd":3527,"text":"| 常数 | 值 | 本质 | 核心公式 | 是否超越？ |\n|------|-----|------|---------|:---:|\n| $\\pi$ | 3.14159... | 圆/周期 | $C = 2\\pi r$ | ✅ (Lindemann 1882) |\n| $e$ | 2.71828... | 自然增长 | $\\frac{d}{dx}e^x = e^x$ | ✅ (Hermite 1873) |\n| $i$ | $\\sqrt{-1}$ | 旋转 | $i^2 = -1$ | 代数数 |\n| $\\gamma$ | 0.57721... | 离散-连续差距 | $H_n - \\ln n \\to \\gamma$ | **未知！** |\n| $\\varphi$ | 1.61803... | 自相似比例 | $\\varphi^2 = \\varphi + 1$ | 代数数 |"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-46","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-46","charStart":3529,"charEnd":3962,"text":"```python\nimport math\n\n# 常数的数值验证\nprint(\"π =\", math.pi)\nprint(\"e =\", math.e)\n\n# 欧拉公式验证\nprint(f\"e^(iπ) + 1 = {abs(math.e**(1j*math.pi) + 1):.1e} ≈ 0\")\n\n# Euler-Mascheroni 常数近似\nn = 1000000\nharmonic = sum(1/k for k in range(1, n+1))\ngamma_approx = harmonic - math.log(n)\nprint(f\"γ ≈ {gamma_approx:.6f} (精确值: 0.577216)\")\n\n# 黄金比例\nphi = (1 + math.sqrt(5)) / 2\nprint(f\"φ = {phi:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"φ² = {phi**2:.6f}, φ+1 = {phi+1:.6f} (相等!)\")\n```"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-47","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-47","charStart":3964,"charEnd":3967,"text":"---"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-48","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-48","charStart":3969,"charEnd":3984,"text":"## 11.7 本章关键点汇总"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-49","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-49","charStart":3986,"charEnd":4289,"text":"| # | 关键概念 | 直觉 | 连接章节 |\n|---|---------|------|---------|\n| 1 | **$\\pi$** | 圆→周期→无处不在 | $\\S$3 级数, $\\S$5 Fourier |\n| 2 | **$e$** | 导数等于自身的函数底数 | $\\S$12 微积分 |\n| 3 | **$e^{i\\pi}+1=0$** | 五常数统一 | $\\S$1 复数 |\n| 4 | **$\\gamma$** | 调和级数与对数的差距 | $\\S$3 级数, $\\S$15 数论 |\n| 5 | **$\\varphi$** | 自相似性的数学化身 | $\\S$6 几何 |"}
{"id":"span:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7-50","sourceId":"source:11-constants-140ce51a25193ff7","blockId":"11-constants#block-50","charStart":4291,"charEnd":4412,"text":"> 💡 **核心哲学**：数学常数不是\"某个聪明人定义的数值\"，而是在探索完全不同的数学问题时反复出现的\"必然数值\"。$\\pi$ 在 Basel 问题中的出现暗示了离散求和与连续几何之间尚未完全理解的深层联系——这正是数学统一性的魅力所在。"}
